{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19107390","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19107390","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1910739001:1":{"text":"Mother Goddess, you are the current, the cycle, and all things... You may not remember the name of a single fragment, but I remember.","source_cn":"母神，您是洋流，是循环，是万物……您或许不会记得一片碎...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x95CB7DE0327F7976","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1910739002:1":{"text":"Estella, my dead wife. Her smile was a crescent moon, her voice a clear spring. She returned to your body when you last awoke. For centuries she has existed somewhere inside you. I know this. I know it!","source_cn":"爱丝特菈——我的亡妻！笑颜如月牙，歌声婉转如清泉，她在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x364BFC1FDEC26CD1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1910739003:1":{"text":"I have sinned. I ended the lives of my own kin. But I beg you... with this broken body and sinful soul... I beg you!","source_cn":"我犯下了过错，我终结了同族的生命，但是我祈求……我用自...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF363048A8CE30B4F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1910739004:1":{"text":"Let my love return to my side once more!","source_cn":"让我的爱，再次回到我身边吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x17517DEAA785D852","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":